<!--
  SHA-256 digests of the signing certificates permitted to use the inference service.

  These are NOT interchangeable with the app's own signature. The three apps in this
  family are signed by three different keys, so a plain "signature" permission would
  never be granted to any of them:

    Poop Schedule   CN=Poop Schedule   98198cd1...
    Cannsheet Mobile CN=Android Debug  a9787249...
    LocalLLM         (its own key)

  Verified from the installed and published APKs on 2026-08-18 with
  the apksigner certificate-printing option. See docs/DECISIONS.md.

  To add a client: publish it, read its digest with apksigner, add it here, and ship a
  new LocalLLM. A digest cannot be added retroactively to an already-installed LocalLLM.
-->
<resources>
